    "overview": "YuE2 3B runs two language models before a short diffusion pass. With ABC Planning on, the first LM writes a symbolic plan (melody, and chords in Full mode) that steers the song; the second turns style, lyrics and that plan into acoustic conditioning sized to the requested duration; a 32-step dpm_2 sampler then fills the audio latent and the VAE decodes it to a song. Keep musical instructions in Style and only sung words in Lyrics.",
